{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00121",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 6.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "All set here, doctor. Chart's updated, and I'll read the readings out when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.16,
      "end_seconds": 11.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.08,
      "end_seconds": 18.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Um, honestly, it's trouble sleeping, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.88,
      "end_seconds": 24.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "How long have you had it? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.35,
      "end_seconds": 27.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "I've had it for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.25,
      "end_seconds": 31.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "What makes it worse, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.93,
      "end_seconds": 33.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Worrying definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.14,
      "end_seconds": 38.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Have you been feeling exhausted in the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.49,
      "end_seconds": 41.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.98,
      "end_seconds": 47.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.79,
      "end_seconds": 52.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.56,
      "end_seconds": 58.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any low mood, heavy caffeine or snoring?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.78,
      "end_seconds": 60.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.53,
      "end_seconds": 73.7,
      "duration_seconds": 12.17,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.03,
      "end_seconds": 76.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.37,
      "end_seconds": 82.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.77,
      "end_seconds": 85.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.84,
      "end_seconds": 88.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.98,
      "end_seconds": 89.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.89,
      "end_seconds": 102.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.11,
      "end_seconds": 107.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.65,
      "end_seconds": 122.5,
      "duration_seconds": 14.85,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.36,
      "end_seconds": 124.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.38,
      "end_seconds": 129.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.38,
      "end_seconds": 131.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.7,
      "end_seconds": 134.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.41,
      "end_seconds": 137.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.55,
      "end_seconds": 140.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.24,
      "end_seconds": 149.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "Just a lump removed from my back, years ago. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.87,
      "end_seconds": 155.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.54,
      "end_seconds": 156.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.84,
      "end_seconds": 171.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 171.91,
      "end_seconds": 179.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. BP is 119 over 78, height 164 centimetres. Respiratory rate 16, weight 70 kilos, heart rate 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.06,
      "end_seconds": 185.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Thanks. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.61,
      "end_seconds": 190.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.38,
      "end_seconds": 194.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.38,
      "end_seconds": 202.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.13,
      "end_seconds": 209.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "From what you've told me, this looks most like insomnia, probably stress-related."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.4,
      "end_seconds": 212.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.95,
      "end_seconds": 227.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.09,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with insomnia, probably stress-related do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had trouble sleeping for about a year, and no heavy caffeine or snoring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.43,
      "end_seconds": 228.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.5,
      "end_seconds": 231.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.19,
      "end_seconds": 234.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.22,
      "end_seconds": 278.37,
      "duration_seconds": 28.15,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. We should do a sleep study for insomnia. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Same wake-up time every day, no screens in the hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.86,
      "end_seconds": 280.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.19,
      "end_seconds": 283.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Let's review you in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.07,
      "end_seconds": 284.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.9,
      "end_seconds": 293.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.82,
      "end_seconds": 299.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "So, I come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.64,
      "end_seconds": 304.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.04,
      "end_seconds": 308.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}